tion on the web.', '私はウェブでその情報を見つけた。', 'us_mvp_image_0361_web.webp', 'say-6264080e-4132bb69-d3339580-ae87d022-b5aaa9c5.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'symbol'), 'シンプル', 'The heart is a symbol of love.', 'ハートは愛の象徴だ。', 'us_mvp_image_0362_symbol.webp', 'say-afb623f5-8430d4fe-79e7e33a-d14e38aa-ac82c826.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'analysis'), 'シンプル', 'The scientist conducted an analysis of the data.', 'その科学者はデータの分析を行った。', 'us_mvp_image_0363_analysis.webp', 'say-256db4a3-2856a24a-ed1a1fa2-2923bfa2-945d7dd5.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'version'), 'シンプル', 'This is the latest version of the software.', 'これはソフトウェアの最新バージョンだ。', 'us_mvp_image_0364_version.webp', 'say-83c29566-f25ac5d1-e9453447-3fdb05ba-c350627a.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'perspective'), 'シンプル', 'Try to see the issue from a different perspective.', 'その問題を別の視点から見てみよう。', 'us_mvp_image_0365_perspective.webp', 'say-773af773-7b4db5d6-5d0d9b25-13c53a45-2adc67d7.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'crisis'), 'シンプル', 'The world is facing an economic crisis.', '世界は経済危機に直面している。', 'us_mvp_image_0366_crisis.webp', 'say-f866665c-71befce7-470fca72-3ce4ded4-741631b9.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'disaster'), 'シンプル', 'The earthquake was a major disaster.', 'その地震は大災害だった。', 'us_mvp_image_0367_disaster.webp', 'say-8c80131f-aa44b17a-077532aa-d9a36b80-ba31007b.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'lecture'), 'シンプル', 'She gave an interesting lecture on history.', '彼女は歴史について興味深い講義を行った。', 'us_mvp_image_0368_lecture.webp', 'say-20edc7c5-da42747b-7b2a892f-9255b316-a2967a3a.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'psychology'), 'シンプル', 'She is studying psychology at university.', '彼女は大学で心理学を学んでいる。', 'us_mvp_image_0369_psychology.webp', 'say-7c2f153f-4d164f11-f98064a0-43cd8e19-7af8cad3.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'gender'), 'シンプル', 'The survey examines gender differences.', 'その調査は性別の違いを調べている。', 'us_mvp_image_0370_gender.webp', 'say-77b4d09d-a954f6ee-f632083b-5bc3c03d-fe8c3594.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'custom'), 'シンプル', 'Shaking hands is a common custom.', '握手は一般的な習慣だ。', 'us_mvp_image_0371_custom.webp', 'say-d1bedf18-3c4385ad-dc3a995f-528b3f08-5afdedd7.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'court'), 'シンプル', 'He was called to court as a witness.', '彼は証人として法廷に呼ばれた。', 'us_mvp_image_0372_court.webp', 'say-ff59b5f1-96d0e51a-c33cfd91-85e4d82d-46955cd1.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'desert'), 'シンプル', 'The Sahara is the largest desert.', 'サハラは世界最大の砂漠だ。', 'us_mvp_image_0373_desert.webp', 'say-0489cb78-72f858c9-7aefff0d-7f4f46e3-da197063.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'soil'), 'シンプル', 'The farmer tested the soil quality.', 'その農家は土壌の質を調べた。', 'us_mvp_image_0374_soil.webp', 'say-cdba2253-294edc7e-f948aeae-829b9fb1-edc329ef.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'agriculture'), 'シンプル', 'Agriculture is vital to human survival.', '農業は人類の生存に不可欠だ。', 'us_mvp_image_0375_agriculture.webp', 'say-31421e6a-2554398b-059dedad-9d9fe65f-b4854088.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'fossil'), 'シンプル', 'They discovered a dinosaur fossil.', '彼らは恐竜の化石を発見した。', 'us_mvp_image_0376_fossil.webp', 'say-7caae8fc-94866dac-40636d4e-454edd8c-40020c22.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'document'), 'シンプル', 'Please sign this document.', 'この書類に署名してください。', 'us_mvp_image_0377_document.webp', 'say-04828aa8-7c34eda4-e7ad6f58-9a0d9133-577e3bee.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'vocabulary'), 'シンプル', 'He has a large vocabulary.', '彼は語彙が豊富だ。', 'us_mvp_image_0378_vocabulary.webp', 'say-73b3baee-da783af3-d11c9692-9db5788e-7712058b.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'military'), 'シンプル', 'He joined the military last year.', '彼は昨年軍に入隊した。', 'us_mvp_image_0388_military.webp', 'say-cc652193-ceeff1a7-78b24264-e5d9a712-66293a2c.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'mass'), 'シンプル', 'There was a mass protest.', '大規模な抗議があった。', 'us_mvp_image_0397_mass.webp', 'say-65f4ceeb-6c343e84-90b738c9-014194b3-398553fe.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'tear'), 'シンプル', 'She tore the paper in half.', '彼女は紙を半分に引き裂いた。', 'us_mvp_image_0410_tear.webp', 'say-a8d60ac9-e19b8626-c820783b-08d37fb7-65aa2ba1.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'praise'), 'シンプル', 'The teacher praised the students.', '先生は生徒たちを褒めた。', 'us_mvp_image_0425_praise.webp', 'say-02161def-37d1d270-9e0558fd-3428deb4-6edaa14d.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'favor'), 'シンプル', 'I favor this plan over the other.', '私はこの計画を他の計画より好む。', 'us_mvp_image_0434_favor.webp', 'say-af632737-131ddf88-b3cecf3d-55cd40bf-2b8df389.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'comment'), 'シンプル', 'She made a useful comment.', '彼女は有益なコメントをした。', 'us_mvp_image_0441_comment.webp', 'say-7e0b239a-b32fc350-65ff8cc8-f4039694-e6e29fbf.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'instruction'), 'シンプル', 'Follow the instructions carefully.', '指示に注意深く従ってください。', 'us_mvp_image_0442_instruction.webp', 'say-916443bd-6163cfeb-e151f4ed-4be5c0e8-ddff688e.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'religion'), 'シンプル', 'Freedom of religion is important.', '宗教の自由は重要だ。', 'us_mvp_image_0443_religion.webp', 'say-ac337a4e-6509e0e0-94cf0601-ac7603e6-bf8ed798.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'neighborhood'), 'シンプル', 'This neighborhood is very quiet.', 'この近所はとても静かだ。', 'us_mvp_image_0444_neighborhood.webp', 'say-1b5e57d7-b41bcf95-c0807291-1a749a8d-71172e2b.mp3', NOW(), NOW());
