1b9b-a9e6d52b-cc135ffa-431c4609-7e922f2f.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'mall'), 'シンプル', 'We went to the mall to buy clothes.', '私たちは服を買いにショッピングモールへ行った。', 'us_mvp_image_0853_mall.webp', 'say-54496564-c45441f0-234f9a3f-064216d5-80264b1d.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'grocery'), 'シンプル', 'She bought vegetables at the grocery store.', '彼女は食料品店で野菜を買った。', 'us_mvp_image_0854_grocery.webp', 'say-02887adb-7dc084d8-30032c8a-a7cabdce-0780c59e.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'humor'), 'シンプル', 'He has a great sense of humor.', '彼はユーモアのセンスがある。', 'us_mvp_image_0855_humor.webp', 'say-bf31c049-fb1b8b3b-68b61549-b107b9b8-5147e30d.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'instinct'), 'シンプル', 'Animals rely on their instincts.', '動物は本能に頼る。', 'us_mvp_image_0856_instinct.webp', 'say-c4e9dd98-e1407f25-c8359d93-dd3668d8-870c0822.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'faith'), 'シンプル', 'She has strong faith in her beliefs.', '彼女は自分の信念を強く信じている。', 'us_mvp_image_0857_faith.webp', 'say-838a188e-d5f65b12-a57d6833-20f09076-07b66647.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'incentive'), 'シンプル', 'The company offers a financial incentive.', 'その会社は金銭的な奨励策を提供する。', 'us_mvp_image_0859_incentive.webp', 'say-4225e79e-c8a34f15-dac185c2-8aeeab54-d464ace1.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'prospect'), 'シンプル', 'The prospects for economic growth are good.', '経済成長の見込みは良好だ。', 'us_mvp_image_0860_prospect.webp', 'say-0bf6e8a5-b15b0b82-27ecacab-39ebe9f8-34864751.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'obstacle'), 'シンプル', 'Lack of money is a major obstacle.', '資金不足が大きな障害だ。', 'us_mvp_image_0861_obstacle.webp', 'say-8f4d09a8-94bd906a-5abc88b1-cafa90b1-0e435d46.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'architecture'), 'シンプル', 'Modern architecture is fascinating.', '現代建築は魅力的だ。', 'us_mvp_image_0862_architecture.webp', 'say-c2997337-c9093c25-9afb852d-08d838a2-6e3ac959.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'stem'), 'シンプル', 'The problem stems from a lack of communication.', 'その問題はコミュニケーション不足に起因する。', 'us_mvp_image_0863_stem.webp', 'say-aa1d321b-34dc9c47-95626333-4bf61ba4-8326b730.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'illusion'), 'シンプル', 'The magician created an illusion.', 'そのマジシャンは錯覚を作り出した。', 'us_mvp_image_0864_illusion.webp', 'say-b559a2ce-95752641-319c35ad-5a80fd25-712dcf91.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'discrimination'), 'シンプル', 'Racial discrimination is a serious issue.', '人種差別は深刻な問題だ。', 'us_mvp_image_0865_discrimination.webp', 'say-2d85f658-91bf5602-9029e983-2bc30f15-bb4e01b5.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'flavor'), 'シンプル', 'This soup has a rich flavor.', 'このスープは豊かな風味がある。', 'us_mvp_image_0868_flavor.webp', 'say-c5fbbf43-6b94b36b-76b4ba09-23dcf7c4-4134bec2.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'portion'), 'シンプル', 'He ate a large portion of pasta.', '彼は大量のパスタを食べた。', 'us_mvp_image_0869_portion.webp', 'say-e5951b30-93f12035-081406f8-7a0e6b47-310aa647.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'recipe'), 'シンプル', 'I followed my grandmother’s recipe.', '祖母のレシピに従った。', 'us_mvp_image_0870_recipe.webp', 'say-5352d5cf-ca875e69-74628af1-997ac5f3-ca276ee2.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'luxury'), 'シンプル', 'They stayed in a luxury hotel.', '彼らは高級ホテルに泊まった。', 'us_mvp_image_0871_luxury.webp', 'say-87c3416f-56e173af-695c8a38-f2528195-cea990fb.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'chip'), 'シンプル', 'Be careful not to chip the edge of the plate.', 'お皿の縁を欠かさないように気をつけて。', 'us_mvp_image_0872_chip.webp', 'say-8e809d64-38cac140-ad03fdff-48ab0f79-7c4e5603.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'ritual'), 'シンプル', 'Morning coffee is part of my ritual.', '朝のコーヒーは私の日課の一部だ。', 'us_mvp_image_0873_ritual.webp', 'say-35769719-05183124-95779f93-98107544-48535413.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'sake'), 'シンプル', 'He did it for the sake of his family.', '彼は家族のためにそれをした。', 'us_mvp_image_0874_sake.webp', 'say-3adc4fcb-1a10b7a5-2dd4af27-0371638a-7efed51c.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'council'), 'シンプル', 'The city council approved the plan.', '市議会はその計画を承認した。', 'us_mvp_image_0876_council.webp', 'say-21358cd6-afa08b7a-ec4aea9b-334667f9-9ee63d3c.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'administration'), 'シンプル', 'The new administration introduced reforms.', '新政権は改革を導入した。', 'us_mvp_image_0877_administration.webp', 'say-6c0abb05-ae454b92-fa2e4fed-bbf2c307-ae9caa81.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'curriculum'), 'シンプル', 'The school offers a broad curriculum.', 'その学校は幅広いカリキュラムを提供する。', 'us_mvp_image_0878_curriculum.webp', 'say-58330a5d-2e419bd1-523148b6-b9070e80-0729fa03.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'instant'), 'シンプル', 'He felt an instant connection.', '彼はすぐに親近感を覚えた。', 'us_mvp_image_0891_instant.webp', 'say-6cf6f74b-8ea1455d-7eb57d6e-a1aa7d93-b6413cdb.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'load'), 'シンプル', 'The truck was loaded with goods.', 'トラックには荷物が積まれていた。', 'us_mvp_image_0905_load.webp', 'say-8b300a4c-b8864b94-fad4232c-e1480865-1bbb0c72.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'float'), 'シンプル', 'The boat floated on the water.', 'ボートは水に浮かんでいた。', 'us_mvp_image_0908_float.webp', 'say-83cf1dfe-d111ed95-e694015c-91aec4a6-7552c314.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'substitute'), 'シンプル', 'You can substitute sugar with honey.', '砂糖の代わりにはちみつを使うことができる。', 'us_mvp_image_0910_substitute.webp', 'say-21de262b-61db574c-d5fb4997-9a251ba8-4a42ac52.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'fold'), 'シンプル', 'She folded the paper neatly.', '彼女は紙をきれいに折った。', 'us_mvp_image_0932_fold.webp', 'say-db793757-2e9ae623-55bcd786-84a94b62-d245953e.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'privilege'), 'シンプル', 'Education is a privilege, not a right.', '教育は特権であり、権利ではない。', 'us_mvp_image_0941_privilege.webp', 'say-67c65621-971d780f-49c7ee50-9d5a2f1f-0268b7ef.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'formation'), 'シンプル', 'The formation of clouds depends on humidity.', '雲の形成は湿度による。', 'us_mvp_image_0942_formation.webp', 'say-e749c889-0bd60198-7113e1f0-def5ca00-d6134ad2.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'dimension'), 'シンプル', 'This issue has a political dimension.', 'この問題には政治的な側面がある。', 'us_mvp_image_0943_dimension.webp', 'say-87318598-42b71947-25d15c0b-36f6a74b-61b0e771.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'neuron'), 'シンプル', 'The brain is made up of billions of neurons.', '脳は数十億の神経細胞でできている。', 'us_mvp_image_0944_neuron.webp', 'say-c35ef53d-fec7f70b-3ae0f65a-c5eaced2-3e32072c.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'sensation'), 'シンプル', 'I had a strange sensation in my arm.', '私の腕に奇妙な感覚があった。', 'us_mvp_image_0945_sensation.webp', 'say-969ac0a7-ad1cfb4c-0fa4add9-8c2cfd59-c8cbfb2e.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'chart'), 'シンプル', 'The sales chart shows steady growth.', '売上チャートは安定した成長を示している。', 'us_mvp_image_0946_chart.webp', 'say-6e2b46ba-5181c44e-dcf19105-a79fa99c-b8defb8a.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'geography'), 'シンプル', 'He is studying world geography.', '彼は世界地理を勉強している。', 'us_mvp_image_0947_geography.webp', 'say-12445bb1-40134a90-3750e515-c0e6c4ba-4eb2325d.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'panel'), 'シンプル', 'The experts formed a panel discussion.', '専門家たちがパネルディスカッションを行った。', 'us_mvp_image_0948_panel.webp', 'say-b88f9ebf-e9b6e234-f4d9ce97-08536ca6-d2060318.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'semester'), 'シンプル', 'The fall semester starts in September.', '秋学期は9月に始まる。', 'us_mvp_image_0949_semester.webp', 'say-7c612d0c-e4c2c7da-f81298f7-400017f1-aea514fd.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'workforce'), 'シンプル', 'The company has a skilled workforce.', 'その会社には熟練した労働力がある。', 'us_mvp_image_0950_workforce.webp', 'say-7003486a-0134410c-9be58e26-2e4bed49-442dfc50.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'mill'), 'シンプル', 'The old mill by the river is now a museum.', '川のそばの古い製粉所は今は博物館になっている。', 'us_mvp_image_0951_mill.webp', 'say-fad93350-e4389ee8-e6ea22a0-c6669586-69ca030a.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'vice'), 'シンプル', 'Gambling can be a dangerous vice.', 'ギャンブルは危険な悪習になり得る。', 'us_mvp_image_0953_vice.webp', 'say-6cf2a6d2-e0352248-16e2e7c8-1b24c84a-3e5162d7.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'fate'), 'シンプル', 'She believes that fate brought them together.', '彼女は運命が二人を引き合わせたと信じている。', 'us_mvp_image_0954_fate.webp', 'say-cab381fb-2df1a782-030eec96-a5877e5d-05635733.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'scenario'), 'シンプル', 'The worst-case scenario is losing all our data.', '最悪のシナリオはすべてのデータを失うことだ。', 'us_mvp_image_0956_scenario.webp', 'say-22a6466f-092f283a-53db5525-1f10fbf5-00e2d0f3.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'wound'), 'シンプル', 'The soldier had a deep wound on his leg.', 'その兵士は足に深い傷を負っていた。', 'us_mvp_image_0958_wound.webp', 'say-e3c1f245-49d20949-e87eab34-1839f665-485c3dc1.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'vaccine'), 'シンプル', 'She received a flu vaccine last week.', '彼女は先週、インフルエンザのワクチンを接種した。', 'us_mvp_image_0960_vaccine.webp', 'say-01707d46-e399e58c-641f6efe-2cd3e48d-acec65be.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'metaphor'), 'シンプル', 'Time is money is a common metaphor.', '「時間はお金である」は一般的な比喩だ。', 'us_mvp_image_0961_metaphor.webp', 'say-0548daa9-97597a74-9234c35f-997d2c2b-24e99cca.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'fare'), 'シンプル', 'The bus fare has increased this year.', '今年、バスの運賃が値上がりした。', 'us_mvp_image_0963_fare.webp', 'say-0054caae-2fb2b833-82e2aa67-0bcd5be5-8ab7b807.mp3', NOW(), NOW());
