cient treasures.', 'その博物館には古代の宝がある。', 'us_mvp_image_0576_treasure.webp', 'say-8bd4628f-91d6c776-dbbcdff9-db221f38-36b227ea.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'dialogue'), 'シンプル', 'The movie has great dialogue.', 'その映画には素晴らしい会話がある。', 'us_mvp_image_0676_dialogue.webp', 'say-35b2dbb9-f708e59d-60854194-464cd5ba-e6d7f2b3.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'sophisticated'), 'シンプル', 'The software is highly sophisticated.', 'そのソフトウェアは非常に精巧だ。', 'us_mvp_image_0684_sophisticated.webp', 'say-2d004919-58ffa833-fade1718-2e78f199-2598f1a1.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'extinct'), 'シンプル', 'Dinosaurs are extinct animals.', '恐竜は絶滅した動物だ。', 'us_mvp_image_0694_extinct.webp', 'say-7089d1bc-19aa9e6f-49ec4f61-d972448b-241c4603.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'rude'), 'シンプル', 'It was rude of him to interrupt.', '彼が話を遮るのは失礼だった。', 'us_mvp_image_0697_rude.webp', 'say-e558ed34-df56bc09-5d95005f-d0882b94-8aaf13f8.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'melt'), 'シンプル', 'The ice melted in the sun.', '氷が太陽の下で溶けた。', 'us_mvp_image_0704_melt.webp', 'say-861e4a34-887e57f7-6cfa4604-bc637a44-2310bf7f.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'endanger'), 'シンプル', 'Pollution endangers marine life.', '汚染は海洋生物を危険にさらす。', 'us_mvp_image_0716_endanger.webp', 'say-7fffa618-2f9a97c4-2aaa3c12-d132b5b1-1482e01f.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'imitate'), 'シンプル', 'The child imitates his father.', 'その子は父親のまねをする。', 'us_mvp_image_0729_imitate.webp', 'say-169a98b9-0097bb9b-fff008bf-74ffe9a5-909099ad.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'literacy'), 'シンプル', 'Literacy rates are improving.', '読み書き能力の向上が進んでいる。', 'us_mvp_image_0742_literacy.webp', 'say-3194b629-976ccd2d-d89d7ca3-91feb8a7-520a79f7.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'heritage'), 'シンプル', 'Japan has a rich cultural heritage.', '日本は豊かな文