t = 'rob'), 'シンプル', 'He was robbed at gunpoint.', '彼は銃を突きつけられて強盗に遭った。', 'us_mvp_image_1226_rob.webp', 'say-c911115a-9dd0e41e-3070a26c-0e446437-95376f49.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'forgive'), 'シンプル', 'She forgave him for his mistake.', '彼女は彼のミスを許した。', 'us_mvp_image_1230_forgive.webp', 'say-b355cf39-28df12dc-956c6847-c24ffc7f-f37db2e5.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'temper'), 'シンプル', 'He has a bad temper.', '彼は気性が荒い。', 'us_mvp_image_1247_temper.webp', 'say-c81d7a00-6b1a70e9-65513bf2-6f94e9a2-0a52703b.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'herd'), 'シンプル', 'A herd of sheep was grazing in the field.', '羊の群れが野原で草を食べていた。', 'us_mvp_image_1253_herd.webp', 'say-5f164154-db2520f3-b760ada1-22d6e3b8-5ada7317.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'pity'), 'シンプル', 'I felt pity for the homeless man.', 'そのホームレスの男性に哀れみを感じた。', 'us_mvp_image_1255_pity.webp', 'say-aa696f21-01d40e31-998049b5-7e54be24-dcd8f8f0.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'priest'), 'シンプル', 'The priest led the ceremony.', 'その神父が儀式を執り行った。', 'us_mvp_image_1256_priest.webp', 'say-4c7c7e89-d0423141-ed6ec9bb-c04b8853-d971c868.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'acquaintance'), 'シンプル', 'He is just a business acquaintance.', '彼はただの仕事上の知人だ。', 'us_mvp_image_1257_acquaintance.webp', 'say-c6ab7625-c2c1f7ed-ff20ce15-93b77d8d-f21a0293.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'famine'), 'シンプル', 'Many people died during the famine.', 'その飢饉の間に多くの人が亡くなった。', 'us_mvp_image_1259_famine.webp', 'say-32cae340-7f1008dd-98ca2eca-81218dc5-03e0a982.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'deforestation'), 'シンプル', 'Deforestation is a major environmental problem.', '森林破壊は大きな環境問題だ。', 'us_mvp_image_1260_deforestation.webp', 'say-87d2ad83-089dd57d-174432bc-a7de0af3-93f2b1f7.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'debris'), 'シン