 'say-2e2e974e-ae871b5b-1437add6-c66d829c-6f01687c.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'beg'), 'シンプル', 'He begged for mercy.', '彼は許しを懇願した。', 'us_mvp_image_1417_beg.webp', 'say-fdab8e21-6c91074f-d0a8e848-46e64dac-6fedcfad.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'inhabit'), 'シンプル', 'Polar bears inhabit the Arctic.', 'ホッキョクグマは北極に生息している。', 'us_mvp_image_1418_inhabit.webp', 'say-1c2367b0-672733bc-f7b9e53d-88b60b5d-5e64d3d4.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'comprehend'), 'シンプル', 'He couldn''t comprehend the complex theory.', '彼はその複雑な理論を理解できなかった。', 'us_mvp_image_1420_comprehend.webp', 'say-0cf15752-e510323a-914cb1c7-822e9a3a-939fb80f.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'cram'), 'シンプル', 'He crammed for the exam last night.', '彼は昨夜試験勉強を詰め込んだ。', 'us_mvp_image_1422_cram.webp', 'say-a1c7acc3-79865ff1-d3d98f53-fc4fb34c-eaa43cf5.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'flock'), 'シンプル', 'Tourists flocked to the famous landmark.', '観光客がその有名な名所に群がった。', 'us_mvp_image_1423_flock.webp', 'say-94d4bd4d-b4641ec7-8be0fd18-5ac67872-69fb7b72.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'glow'), 'シンプル', 'The fireflies glowed in the dark.', 'ホタルが暗闇で光った。', 'us_mvp_image_1429_glow.webp', 'say-f9756dfb-9d3fa83c-5448ffc2-176f1091-7e6d6ff3.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'dairy'), 'シンプル', 'He is allergic to dairy products.', '彼は乳製品にアレルギーがある。', 'us_mvp_image_1449_dairy.webp', 'say-32f18495-e8435276-f2cd7818-4c86451d-c0ca9aa0.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'compassion'), 'シンプル', 'She showed compassion for the homeless.', '彼女はホームレスに思いやりを示した。', 'us_mvp_image_1450_compassion.webp', 'say-a777a772-eca80055-a43a220a-bb1ac06f-cceb8261.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'posture'), 'シンプル', 'He has good posture when sitting.', '彼は座るときの姿勢が良い。', 'us_mvp_image_1451_posture.webp', 'say-f5cfef20-77b53429-e68424bf-316ce2e8-459e2a2c.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'curse'), 'シンプル', 'He shouted a curse in anger.', '彼は怒りでののしりの言葉を叫んだ。', 'us_mvp_image_1452_curse.webp', 'say-25fa32e5-bc728297-1bcab015-a69004e7-1dff9f44.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'funeral'), 'シンプル', 'Many people attended the funeral.', '多くの人が葬式に参列した。', 'us_mvp_image_1453_funeral.webp', 'say-e11a57e4-1a91f99e-0fe680e1-e71c2bab-2bccac59.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'cereal'), 'シンプル', 'He eats cereal for breakfast.', '彼は朝食にシリアルを食べる。', 'us_mvp_image_1456_cereal.webp', 'say-58dc2ea0-8d73e51f-ac3538ea-cb94fbd5-b77bd4df.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'rubbish'), 'シンプル', 'This movie is complete rubbish.', 'この映画は完全にくだらない。', 'us_mvp_image_1459_rubbish.webp', 'say-c87ee963-b5e9b53e-6f2d3a25-7621f018-760dbb73.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'maze'), 'シンプル', 'The garden has a beautiful maze.', 'その庭には美しい迷路がある。', 'us_mvp_image_1460_maze.webp', 'say-7fe04ce5-a74f88ff-74ef6734-0735981a-b9d9fb3c.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'spectator'), 'シンプル', 'Thousands of spectators watched the game.', '何千人もの観客が試合を観戦した。', 'us_mvp_image_1465_spectator.webp', 'say-aa13fbe4-9eb9eb6d-06eea654-fd26bb96-69a3e413.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'blade'), 'シンプル', 'The knife has a sharp blade.', 'そのナイフは鋭い刃を持っている。', 'us_mvp_image_1471_blade.webp', 'say-9df515fe-ce885ce7-9df289f1-94ec7f71-cadf60d5.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'collision'), 'シンプル', 'The two cars were involved in a collision.', 'その2台の車は衝突事故に巻き込まれた。', 'us_mvp_image_1474_collision.webp', 'say-dbdf29a9-4bcb0b7b-159cfed3-88e4e30d-f7f755aa.mp3', NOW(), NOW()),((SELECT id FROM words WHERE word_text = 'landmark'), 'シンプル', 'The Eiffel Tower is a famous landmark.', 'エッフェル塔は有名なランドマークだ。', 'us_mvp_image_1476_landmark.webp', 'say-664c4013-40ce3d8